OL,3,GNEWSANew data centres must bring 'local
OL,4,Abenefits'
OL,5,
OL,6,FGovernment plans to impose "strict
OL,7,Ftests" on data centres before they can
OL,8,Fbe built have received a cautious
OL,9,Fwelcome in an area which could soon be
OL,10,Fhome to three such facilities.
OL,12,FDuring Wednesday's Budget speech,
OL,13,FChancellor John Healey said new centres
OL,14,Fwould face requirements to "invest in
OL,15,Flocal communities, create local jobs
OL,16,Fand protect local water supplies".
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,395,390,260,160,0,100
