OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSANew data centres must bring 'local
OL,4,Abenefits'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Conservative leader of
OL,7,FNorthumberland County Council, which
OL,8,Fgave US firm QTS the go-ahead for a
OL,9,F#10bn facility at Cambois and is
OL,10,Fconsidering two more applications, said
OL,11,Fthe sector was "absolutely critical"
OL,12,Ffor the economy.
OL,14,FMeanwhile, the local Labour MP welcomed
OL,15,FHealey's pledge but warned the "devil
OL,16,Fis in the detail".
